# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values. Never commit .env.
#
# Gradle reads .env at BUILD time and writes each entry into BuildConfig
# (see app/build.gradle.kts). BuildConfig ships inside the APK, so any value
# here can be recovered from a released build. Put only non-sensitive
# configuration in this file. Keep a real secret on a server you control.
#
# This project currently needs no variables. It is local-only: it declares no
# INTERNET permission and calls no remote service. Add an entry below only
# when code actually reads it.

# Example of the expected format:
# FEATURE_FLAG_NEW_BUILDER=false
